    doc:hasQuote "Follow-ups (next week): 1) Ava: update Confluence owner mapping + decision tree language and link it from the incident classification policy. ETA Tue 1/13. 2) Rafael: confirm escalation rule wording for CAPACITY incidents (Fleet primary + Routing notified) and align with incident-bot closure gating. ETA Wed 1/14. 3) Mina/Vanessa: provide 2-3 concrete examples each for the taxonomy page (what to pick, what not to pick). ETA Wed 1/14. 4) Routing team: ensure fallback_reason enums land + are visible in the incident channel bot summary (ENG-4824). Tracking separately." ;
