    doc:hasQuote "# Corrective actions 1. Add fragmentation metric: \"sched_place_fail_rate\" + \"gpu_mem_slack\" (owner: Eng Infra) 2. Publish runbook for defragmentation and safe evacuation in private clusters (owner: Eng Infra) 3. Add preflight capacity validation before maintenance rotations (owner: Eng SRE)" ;
